#: ../../library/pstats.rst:5
msgid ":mod:`!pstats` --- Statistics for profilers"
msgstr ":mod:`!pstats` --- 性能分析器的统计信息"

#: ../../library/pstats.rst:10
msgid "**Source code:** :source:`Lib/pstats.py`"
msgstr "**源代码:** :source:`Lib/pstats.py`"

#: ../../library/pstats.rst:14
msgid ""
"The :mod:`!pstats` module provides tools for reading, manipulating, and "
"displaying profiling statistics generated by Python's profilers. It reads "
"output from both :mod:`profiling.tracing` (deterministic profiler) and "
":mod:`profiling.sampling` (statistical profiler)."
msgstr ""
":mod:`!pstats` 模块提供了用于读取、操纵和显示由 Python 的性能分析器生成的性能分析统计信息。 它能够读取来自 "
":mod:`profiling.tracing` (确定型性能分析器) 和 :mod:`profiling.sampling` (统计型性能分析器) "
"的输出。"

#: ../../library/pstats.rst:21
msgid "Reading and displaying profile data"
msgstr "读取和显示性能分析数据"

#: ../../library/pstats.rst:23
msgid ""
"The :class:`Stats` class is the primary interface for working with profile "
"data. It can read statistics from files or directly from a "
":class:`~profiling.tracing.Profile` object."
msgstr ""
":class:`Stats` 类是用于处理性能分析数据的主要接口。 它可以读取来自文件或者直接来自 "
":class:`~profiling.tracing.Profile` 对象的统计信息。"

#: ../../library/pstats.rst:27
msgid "Load statistics from a file and print a basic report::"
msgstr "加载来自文件的统计信息并打印基础报告::"

#: ../../library/pstats.rst:29
msgid ""
"import pstats\n"
"\n"
"p = pstats.Stats('profile_output.prof')\n"
"p.print_stats()"
msgstr ""
"import pstats\n"
"\n"
"p = pstats.Stats('profile_output.prof')\n"
"p.print_stats()"

#: ../../library/pstats.rst:34
msgid ""
"The :class:`Stats` object provides methods for sorting and filtering the "
"data before printing. For example, to see the ten functions with the highest"
" cumulative time::"
msgstr ":class:`Stats` 对象提供了在打印之前对数据进行排序和过滤的方法。 举例来说，如果要查看累积时间最多的十个函数::"

#: ../../library/pstats.rst:38
msgid ""
"from pstats import SortKey\n"
"\n"
"p = pstats.Stats('profile_output.prof')\n"
"p.sort_stats(SortKey.CUMULATIVE).print_stats(10)"
msgstr ""
"from pstats import SortKey\n"
"\n"
"p = pstats.Stats('profile_output.prof')\n"
"p.sort_stats(SortKey.CUMULATIVE).print_stats(10)"

#: ../../library/pstats.rst:45
msgid "Working with statistics"
msgstr "运用统计学"

#: ../../library/pstats.rst:47
msgid ""
"The :class:`Stats` class supports method chaining, making it convenient to "
"perform multiple operations::"
msgstr ":class:`Stats` 类支持方法链式调用，从而便于执行多个操作::"

#: ../../library/pstats.rst:50
msgid ""
"p = pstats.Stats('restats')\n"
"p.strip_dirs().sort_stats(-1).print_stats()"
msgstr ""
"p = pstats.Stats('restats')\n"
"p.strip_dirs().sort_stats(-1).print_stats()"

#: ../../library/pstats.rst:53
msgid ""
"The :meth:`~Stats.strip_dirs` method removes directory paths from filenames,"
" making the output more compact. The :meth:`~Stats.sort_stats` method "
"accepts various keys to control the sort order."
msgstr ""
":meth:`~Stats.strip_dirs` 方法会从文件名中移除目录路径，使输出更加简洁；:meth:`~Stats.sort_stats` "
"方法则接受多种键来控制排序顺序。"

#: ../../library/pstats.rst:57
msgid "Different sort keys highlight different aspects of performance::"
msgstr "不同的排序键会突出显示性能的不同方面::"

#: ../../library/pstats.rst:59
msgid ""
"from pstats import SortKey\n"
"\n"
"# Functions that consume the most cumulative time\n"
"p.sort_stats(SortKey.CUMULATIVE).print_stats(10)\n"
"\n"
"# Functions that consume the most time in their own code\n"
"p.sort_stats(SortKey.TIME).print_stats(10)\n"
"\n"
"# Functions sorted by name\n"
"p.sort_stats(SortKey.NAME).print_stats()"
msgstr ""
"from pstats import SortKey\n"
"\n"
"# Functions that consume the most cumulative time\n"
"p.sort_stats(SortKey.CUMULATIVE).print_stats(10)\n"
"\n"
"# Functions that consume the most time in their own code\n"
"p.sort_stats(SortKey.TIME).print_stats(10)\n"
"\n"
"# Functions sorted by name\n"
"p.sort_stats(SortKey.NAME).print_stats()"

#: ../../library/pstats.rst:72
msgid "Filtering output"
msgstr "过滤输出"

#: ../../library/pstats.rst:74
msgid ""
"The :meth:`~Stats.print_stats` method accepts restrictions that filter which"
" functions are displayed. Restrictions can be integers (limiting the count),"
" floats between 0 and 1 (selecting a percentage), or strings (matching "
"function names via regular expression)."
msgstr ""
":meth:`~Stats.print_stats` 方法接受限制条件，用于筛选要显示的函数。限制条件可以是整数（用于限制数量）、0 到 1 "
"之间的浮点数（用于选择百分比），或字符串（通过正则表达式匹配函数名称）。"

#: ../../library/pstats.rst:79
msgid "Print only the top 10%::"
msgstr "仅打印排名前 10% 的结果::"

#: ../../library/pstats.rst:81
msgid "p.print_stats(.1)"
msgstr "p.print_stats(.1)"

#: ../../library/pstats.rst:83
msgid "Print only functions whose names contain \"init\"::"
msgstr "仅打印名称中包含“init”的函数::"

#: ../../library/pstats.rst:85
msgid "p.print_stats('init')"
msgstr "p.print_stats('init')"

#: ../../library/pstats.rst:87
msgid "Combine restrictions (they apply sequentially)::"
msgstr "Combine restrictions (they apply sequentially)::"

#: ../../library/pstats.rst:89
msgid ""
"# Top 10%, then only those containing \"init\"\n"
"p.print_stats(.1, 'init')\n"
"\n"
"# Functions in files matching \"foo:\", limited to top 50%\n"
"p.sort_stats(SortKey.FILENAME).print_stats('foo:', .5)"
msgstr ""
"# Top 10%, then only those containing \"init\"\n"
"p.print_stats(.1, 'init')\n"
"\n"
"# Functions in files matching \"foo:\", limited to top 50%\n"
"p.sort_stats(SortKey.FILENAME).print_stats('foo:', .5)"

#: ../../library/pstats.rst:97
msgid "Analyzing call relationships"
msgstr "分析呼叫关系"

#: ../../library/pstats.rst:99
msgid ""
"The :meth:`~Stats.print_callers` method shows which functions called each "
"displayed function::"
msgstr ":meth:`~Stats.print_callers` 方法会显示调用每个已显示函数的具体函数::"

#: ../../library/pstats.rst:102
msgid "p.print_callers()"
msgstr "p.print_callers()"

#: ../../library/pstats.rst:104
msgid ""
"The :meth:`~Stats.print_callees` method shows the opposite relationship, "
"listing which functions each displayed function called::"
msgstr ":meth:`~Stats.print_callees` 方法则呈现相反的关系，列出每个已显示函数所调用的函数::"

#: ../../library/pstats.rst:107
msgid "p.print_callees()"
msgstr "p.print_callees()"

#: ../../library/pstats.rst:109
msgid ""
"Both methods accept the same restriction arguments as "
":meth:`~Stats.print_stats`."
msgstr "两种方法接受的限制参数与 :meth:`~Stats.print_stats` 相同。"

#: ../../library/pstats.rst:113
msgid "Combining multiple profiles"
msgstr "组合多个配置文件"

#: ../../library/pstats.rst:115
msgid ""
"Statistics from multiple profiling runs can be combined into a single "
":class:`Stats` object::"
msgstr "可将多次特征分析运行的统计数据合并到单个 :class:`Stats` 对象中::"

#: ../../library/pstats.rst:118
msgid ""
"# Load multiple files at once\n"
"p = pstats.Stats('run1.prof', 'run2.prof', 'run3.prof')\n"
"\n"
"# Or add files incrementally\n"
"p = pstats.Stats('run1.prof')\n"
"p.add('run2.prof')\n"
"p.add('run3.prof')"
msgstr ""
"# Load multiple files at once\n"
"p = pstats.Stats('run1.prof', 'run2.prof', 'run3.prof')\n"
"\n"
"# Or add files incrementally\n"
"p = pstats.Stats('run1.prof')\n"
"p.add('run2.prof')\n"
"p.add('run3.prof')"

#: ../../library/pstats.rst:126
msgid ""
"When files are combined, statistics for identical functions (same file, "
"line, and name) are accumulated, giving an aggregate view across all "
"profiling runs."
msgstr "当文件被合并时，相同函数（相同的文件、行和名称）的统计数据会被汇总，从而形成所有性能分析运行结果的聚合视图。"

#: ../../library/pstats.rst:131
msgid "The :class:`!Stats` class"
msgstr ":class:`!Stats` 类"

#: ../../library/pstats.rst:135
msgid "Create a statistics object from profile data."
msgstr "根据配置文件数据创建统计对象。"

#: ../../library/pstats.rst:137
msgid ""
"The arguments can be filenames (strings or path-like objects) or "
":class:`~profiling.tracing.Profile` objects. If multiple sources are "
"provided, their statistics are combined."
msgstr ""
"这些参数可以是文件名（字符串或类路径对象），也可以是 :class:`~profiling.tracing.Profile` "
"对象。如果提供了多个来源，则会将它们的统计信息合并。"

#: ../../library/pstats.rst:141
msgid ""
"The *stream* argument specifies where output from :meth:`print_stats` and "
"related methods is written. It defaults to :data:`sys.stdout`."
msgstr ""
"*stream* 参数用于指定将来自 :meth:`print_stats` 及相关方法的输出写入何处。其默认值为 "
":data:`sys.stdout`。"

#: ../../library/pstats.rst:144
msgid ""
"The profile data format is specific to the Python version that created it. "
"There is no compatibility guarantee between Python versions or between "
"different profilers."
msgstr "配置文件数据格式取决于创建该格式的 Python 版本。Python 版本之间或不同分析器之间不提供兼容性保证。"

#: ../../library/pstats.rst:150
msgid "Remove leading path information from all filenames."
msgstr "从所有文件名中移除前导路径信息。"

#: ../../library/pstats.rst:152
msgid ""
"This method modifies the object in place and returns it for method chaining."
" After stripping, the statistics are considered to be in random order."
msgstr "该方法会在原地修改对象，并将其返回以供方法链式调用。经过剥离后，统计数据将被视为处于随机顺序。"

#: ../../library/pstats.rst:156
msgid ""
"If stripping causes two functions to become indistinguishable (same "
"filename, line number, and function name), their statistics are combined "
"into a single entry."
msgstr "如果剥离导致两个函数变得无法区分（具有相同的文件名、行号和函数名），则它们的统计信息将被合并为一条记录。"

#: ../../library/pstats.rst:162
msgid "Add profiling data from additional files."
msgstr "从其他文件中添加性能分析数据。"

#: ../../library/pstats.rst:164
msgid ""
"The files must have been created by the same profiler type. Statistics for "
"identical functions are accumulated."
msgstr "这些文件必须由同一种类型的 Profiler 创建；相同函数的统计数据会被累加。"

#: ../../library/pstats.rst:169
msgid "Save the current statistics to a file."
msgstr "将当前统计数据保存至文件中。"

#: ../../library/pstats.rst:171
msgid ""
"The file is created if it does not exist and overwritten if it does. The "
"saved data can be loaded by creating a new :class:`Stats` object."
msgstr "如果文件不存在，则将其创建；如果文件已存在，则将其覆盖。保存的数据可通过创建一个新的 :class:`Stats` 对象来加载。"

#: ../../library/pstats.rst:176
msgid "Sort the statistics according to the specified criteria."
msgstr "根据指定的条件对统计数据进行排序。"

#: ../../library/pstats.rst:178
msgid ""
"Each key can be a string or a :class:`SortKey` enum member. When multiple "
"keys are provided, later keys break ties in earlier keys."
msgstr "每个键可以是字符串或 :class:`SortKey` 枚举成员。当提供多个键时，后出现的键会在与先前键值相等的情况下优先胜出。"

#: ../../library/pstats.rst:181
msgid ""
"Using :class:`SortKey` enum members is preferred over strings as it provides"
" better error checking::"
msgstr "使用 :class:`SortKey` 枚举成员比使用字符串更为推荐，因为前者能提供更好的错误检查::"

#: ../../library/pstats.rst:184
msgid ""
"from pstats import SortKey\n"
"p.sort_stats(SortKey.CUMULATIVE)"
msgstr ""
"from pstats import SortKey\n"
"p.sort_stats(SortKey.CUMULATIVE)"

#: ../../library/pstats.rst:187
msgid "Valid sort keys:"
msgstr "有效的排序键："

